  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are able to channel mythic energy to transfer wounds more often.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Extra Transfer.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain two additional daily uses of your transfer wounds or sickening touch ability. Additionally, if you have no uses of transfer wounds or sickening touch remaining, you may expend one uses of mythic power to use your transfer wounds or sickening touch ability.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
